      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T23:51:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want to make explicit what callbacks we are registering. It is not clear when `RemoteNameRequestCallbacks(f)` or `RemoteNameRequestCallbacks(f, g)` are triggered (especially since in the latter case, `g` is triggered before `f`). I guess the type system would catch this since the return types are different, but I\u0027d still prefer to make it really obvious.",
